      "value": "@{5bae340f06f11d421a29d7db|full_name}: @{5becaa4082f0316568f515e3|full_name}: \nVirtual Market is an exhibition for VR creators and users. 2nd one was held in VRChat from 8th March 2019 to 10th. You can see more details on https://www.v-market.work/about-eng \n\nThis Canny issue proposer ちう made \"extended menu\" for Virtual Market2 without custom scripting only with ordinary VRChat SDK and Unity components. That's amazing work. You can see menu functionality in a movie https://twitter.com/Virtual_Market_/status/1103281835717603330 (With English menu items, I think you can get outline though captions are in Japanese). It was very useful for attendees.\n\nThat was possible but use some kind of \"vulnerability\". So latest update of VRChat closed the door. VRChat devs was afraid malicious use of it. So that \"extended menu\" gimmick doesn't work anymore. Then, ちう propose this Canny issue as safer way to do same thing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
